abstract: >-
  Analysis code reproducing the spatial, single-cell and bulk-transcriptomic
  analyses of an HGF-expressing hepatic stellate cell niche adjacent to Hep.4
  hepatocytes in F2 MASLD fibrosis, together with the development and external
  validation of an 11-gene fibrosis signature.
